      {
        "Id": "daab501984fe42c6954d83f4f171a7e7",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE:  open the floor plan (or a section / elevation), then RUN.   1 = what to annotate.   2 = doors get D1, D2.. and windows W1, W2.. in Mark (level by level, top to bottom, left to right); RENUMBER False keeps marks you typed.   3 = VIEWS: CURRENT, ALL PLANS or view names.   4 = RUN False = only count.   Missing tag family -> loaded from the Revit library or default template.  Run again = no second tag / dimension.  Ctrl+Z undoes all.",
        "DescriptionText": "",
